{"id":"80ffe275fe40fc02","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-arrow.md","title":"Arrow","display":"df-arrow — Arrow","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-arrow","aliases":["58-df-arrow"],"display":"df-arrow — Arrow","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-arrow"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-arrow</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arrow — Arrow"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span> (set-coded directed-graph data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in C_1,\\ a,b\\in C_0\">\\(f\\in C_1,\\ a,b\\in C_0\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Arr}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Arr}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> (typed-arrow predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arrow}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Arr}_{\\mathcal C}(f,a,b)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,C_1,C_0)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t,C_1,C_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land f\\in C_1\\land a,b\\in C_0\n\\land s(f)=a\\land t(f)=b\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arrow}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Arr}_{\\mathcal C}(f,a,b)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,C_1,C_0)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t,C_1,C_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land f\\in C_1\\land a,b\\in C_0\n\\land s(f)=a\\land t(f)=b\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Arrows are morphisms with specified source and target. The four graph components are recovered from the code <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> inside the definition, so the truth value does not depend on hidden ambient choices of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0,C_1,s,t\">\\(C_0,C_1,s,t\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in C_1,\\ a,b\\in C_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Arr}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arrow}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Arr}_{\\mathcal C}(f,a,b)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,C_1,C_0)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t,C_1,C_0)\\\\\n&\\land f\\in C_1\\land a,b\\in C_0\n\\land s(f)=a\\land t(f)=b\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"C_0,C_1,s,t","display":false}],"bytes":1032,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-arrow.md|58-df-arrow]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}